🏏 1️⃣ IPL Score Prediction

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📌 Problem Statement

Predict **final IPL score** based on:

* Current score
* Overs completed
* Wickets lost
* Batting team
* Bowling team

---

🎯 Goal

👉 Regression Problem
👉 Predict continuous value (final score)

